            <p class="Division"><a name="13.06.004"></a>Division 13-06-004<br />Drainage Plans</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1306004.html#13.06.004.0001">13-06-004-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drainage Plans</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.06.004.0001"><a name="13.06.004.0001">13-06-004-0001</a> Drainage Plans</h3>
            <p class="P0">Public improvement drainage plans shall be in accordance with the requirements set forth in the City of Flagstaff Stormwater Management Design Manual and Section <a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1306002.html#13.06.002.0007">13-06-002-0007</a>. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

